## 2.9.2  WORKFLOW IMPLEMENTATION

### **Receiving**

PO or ad-hoc receipt → Scan Container / Select PO → System shows expected items → Scan item / quantity → Inspection (if required) → Pass → Assign internal lot → Pallet → Location → Inventory update → Traceability record created (supplier lot → internal lot).

### **Warehouse Transfer**

Scan Pallet → System shows location + lot details → Scan destination location → Confirm → Movement recorded → Inventory updated in real-time.

### **Production**

Create batch (BOM or manual) → System checks availability (committed vs available) → Scan raw material lots → Verify validity (expiry / no hold) → Confirm consumption → Production process (optional stage tracking) → Quality checkpoint (if configured) → Create output lot (parent/child link to consumed lots) → Traceability updated (raw lots → batch → output lot).

### **Packaging**

Select production output lot → Create packaging batch → Create cases (with IDs) → Create finished goods lot → Assign finished pallet → Quality verification (if configured) → Traceability updated (production → packaging → FG → pallet).

### **Shipping**

Select shipment (SO or manual) → Pick inventory → Scan finished goods → Verify lot + customer match → Confirm dispatch → Customer link created → Forward trace complete.

### **Traceability Investigation**

Search any identifier (lot/pallet/case/PO/supplier lot/customer) → Show current record → Backward trace (source) → Forward trace (destination) → Show affected inventory / shipments / customers → Generate recall letter / notification if needed.

